    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"EventPublishingRepositoryProxyPostProcessor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>EventPublishingRepositoryProxyPostProcessor</code></a> for the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationEventPublisher.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationEventPublisher</code></a>.",
      "translation": "为给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationEventPublisher.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationEventPublisher</code></a> 创建一个新的 <a href=\"EventPublishingRepositoryProxyPostProcessor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>EventPublishingRepositoryProxyPostProcessor</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Manipulates the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/aop/framework/ProxyFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.aop.framework\"><code>ProxyFactory</code></a>, e.g. add further interceptors to it.",
      "translation": "操作 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/aop/framework/ProxyFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.aop.framework\"><code>ProxyFactory</code></a>，例如向其添加更多拦截器。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
