      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"RepositoryProxyPostProcessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>RepositoryProxyPostProcessor</code></a> to register a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/aopalliance/intercept/MethodInterceptor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.aopalliance.intercept\"><code>MethodInterceptor</code></a> to intercept\n<a href=\"../../CrudRepository.html#save(S)\"><code>CrudRepository.save(Object)</code></a> and <a href=\"../../CrudRepository.html#delete(T)\"><code>CrudRepository.delete(Object)</code></a> methods and publish events potentially\nexposed via a method annotated with <a href=\"../../../domain/DomainEvents.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>DomainEvents</code></a>. If no such method can be detected on the aggregate root, no\ninterceptor is added. Additionally, the aggregate root can expose a method annotated with\n<a href=\"../../../domain/AfterDomainEventPublication.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>AfterDomainEventPublication</code></a>. If present, the method will be invoked after all events have been published.",
      "translation": "使用 <a href=\"RepositoryProxyPostProcessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>RepositoryProxyPostProcessor</code></a> 注册一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/aopalliance/intercept/MethodInterceptor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.aopalliance.intercept\"><code>MethodInterceptor</code></a>，以拦截 <a href=\"../../CrudRepository.html#save(S)\"><code>CrudRepository.save(Object)</code></a> 和 <a href=\"../../CrudRepository.html#delete(T)\"><code>CrudRepository.delete(Object)</code></a> 方法，并发布可能通过带有 <a href=\"../../../domain/DomainEvents.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>DomainEvents</code></a> 注解的方法暴露的事件。如果在聚合根上无法检测到此类方法，则不会添加拦截器。此外，聚合根可以提供一个带有 <a href=\"../../../domain/AfterDomainEventPublication.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>AfterDomainEventPublication</code></a> 注解的方法。如果存在该方法，将在所有事件发布完成后调用它。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
